From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: System Electronics <ci@sysele.local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] deps/v8/src/base/logging.h: add missing <cstdint> include
 for GCC 13

GCC 13's libstdc++ no longer transitively pulls in <cstdint> via
<cstring>, so the use of uint16_t in
GetUnderlyingEnumTypeForPrinting() fails to compile with:

  error: 'uint16_t' was not declared in this scope

This cascades into unrelated-looking errors in src/base/macros.h,
which includes logging.h and relied on it for the same transitive
<cstdint>.

Upstream-Status: Backport
Signed-off-by: System Electronics <ci@sysele.local>
---
 deps/v8/src/base/logging.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/deps/v8/src/base/logging.h b/deps/v8/src/base/logging.h
--- a/deps/v8/src/base/logging.h
+++ b/deps/v8/src/base/logging.h
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 #define V8_BASE_LOGGING_H_

 #include <cstring>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <sstream>
 #include <string>

--
2.34.1
